  "notes": "Very common word covering emotions, physical sensations, and intentions.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n・{気持|きも}ちがいい (feels good, comfortable)\n・{気持|きも}ちが{悪|わる}い (feels bad, uncomfortable, creepy)\n・{気持|きも}ちを{伝|つた}える (convey one's feelings)\n・{気持|きも}ちが{分|わ}かる (understand someone's feelings)\n・お{気持|きも}ちだけで (just the thought [is enough])\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{気分|きぶん} - mood, feeling (more about general state)\n・{感情|かんじょう} - emotion (more formal/psychological)\n・{心|こころ} - heart, mind (deeper)",
